(3. PRIVACY AND DATA MINIMIZATION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Health and identity information requires heightened protection.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-3.1  Purpose limitation) Tj
T*
(   Collect and use claim data only for authorized insurance operations, legal duties,) Tj
T*
(   quality, fraud control and explicitly approved secondary purposes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-3.2  Minimum necessary) Tj
T*
(   Retrieve and expose only fields and documents required for the task. Mask unrelated) Tj
T*
(   diagnoses, family data, account numbers and identifiers where practical.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-3.3  Access control) Tj
T*
(   Enforce role-based access, strong authentication, least privilege, periodic) Tj
T*
(   recertification and immediate revocation on role change.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-3.4  Encryption and transfer) Tj
T*
(   Protect stored and transmitted data using approved encryption and controlled transfer) Tj
T*
(   channels.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-3.5  Model handling) Tj
T*
(   Do not send claim data to an external model unless contractual, privacy, security,) Tj
T*
(   residency and retention controls are approved.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
