(4. RETENTION AND DELETION) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Production schedules must be approved against current legal and contractual requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-4.1  Retention schedule) Tj
T*
(   Assign records a category, owner, legal basis, retention period and disposal method. This) Tj
T*
(   synthetic document does not prescribe a statutory period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-4.2  Legal hold) Tj
T*
(   Suspend normal deletion for records subject to litigation, investigation, audit or) Tj
T*
(   regulatory hold.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-4.3  Derived data) Tj
T*
(   Embeddings, extracted fields, prompts, logs and model outputs are claim data and follow) Tj
T*
(   equivalent governance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-4.4  Secure disposal) Tj
T*
(   Delete or destroy data verifiably across primary, cache, backup and vendor systems) Tj
T*
(   according to approved procedure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
