(5. GRIEVANCE AND REVIEW) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Members need accessible review of adverse decisions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-5.1  Grievance intake) Tj
T*
(   Accept grievances through approved digital, written and assisted channels. Record) Tj
T*
(   receipt, issue, requested remedy and communication needs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-5.2  Independent review) Tj
T*
(   Where practical, a reviewer not responsible for the original adverse decision reassesses) Tj
T*
(   evidence, policy scope, clauses and calculation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-5.3  Additional evidence) Tj
T*
(   Allow relevant new evidence and explain whether it changes the decision.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-5.4  Response) Tj
T*
(   Provide outcome, reasons, cited clauses, calculation, further escalation route and) Tj
T*
(   applicable external review information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-5.5  Timelines) Tj
T*
(   Configure acknowledgment and resolution timelines from the current contract and) Tj
T*
(   regulatory requirements; do not hard-code an outdated legal period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
