(6. AUDIT TRAIL REQUIREMENTS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(A complete trail permits reconstruction without relying on memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-6.1  Input provenance) Tj
T*
(   Record uploader, channel, receipt time, original filename, hash and transformation) Tj
T*
(   history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-6.2  Policy provenance) Tj
T*
(   Record corpus version, policy ID, effective version, metadata filters, retrieved chunks,) Tj
T*
(   rankings and cited clauses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-6.3  Model provenance) Tj
T*
(   Record model and prompt version, parameters, outputs, confidence and human changes) Tj
T*
(   without exposing secret credentials.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-6.4  Decision provenance) Tj
T*
(   Record reviewer, authority, reason codes, calculation, approval chain, communication and) Tj
T*
(   payment reference.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-6.5  Immutability) Tj
T*
(   Protect material audit records from unauthorized alteration and log permitted corrections) Tj
T*
(   as new events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
