(7. MODEL AND RETRIEVAL GOVERNANCE) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Retrieval systems are controlled decision-support components.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-7.1  Pre-deployment validation) Tj
T*
(   Test representative, rare, adverse, multilingual, OCR-degraded, negated and) Tj
T*
(   conflicting-policy cases.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-7.2  Gold set) Tj
T*
(   Maintain reviewed questions linking claims to authoritative clauses and expected decision) Tj
T*
(   factors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-7.3  Change control) Tj
T*
(   Re-indexing, model changes, chunking changes, policy updates and prompt changes require) Tj
T*
(   versioned testing and approval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-7.4  Monitoring) Tj
T*
(   Monitor drift, retrieval misses, unsupported citations, policy mixing, latency, cost and) Tj
T*
(   decision disparities.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-7.5  Kill switch) Tj
T*
(   Provide a tested mechanism to disable automated recommendation and continue controlled) Tj
T*
(   manual processing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
