(8. INCIDENT RESPONSE) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Security and decision incidents require coordinated action.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-8.1  Incident types) Tj
T*
(   Include unauthorized disclosure, corrupted index, wrong policy version, systematic false) Tj
T*
(   rejection, prompt injection and payment manipulation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-8.2  Containment) Tj
T*
(   Restrict access, stop affected automation, preserve evidence and identify impacted claims) Tj
T*
(   and members.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-8.3  Correction) Tj
T*
(   Reprocess affected claims using a validated version and provide remediation and) Tj
T*
(   notification as required.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(GOV-8.4  Learning) Tj
T*
(   Complete root-cause analysis, corrective controls, regression tests and accountable) Tj
T*
(   closure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
